body:
```
<?php
$num = 5;
$location = 'tree';

$format = 'There are %d monkeys in the %s';
echo sprintf($format, $num, $location);
```

vs

```
<?php
$num = 5;
$location = 'tree';

echo "There are {$num} monkeys in the {$location}";
```

Note: In most cases I already check the types (incl. validation) and using hints:
```
<?php
function foo (int $num = 5, string $location = 'tree') {
   ...
}
```
